{"nodeId":"kp:21260","contents":[],"requirements":{"knowledgeRequirement":{"value":"教材定义严格增函数：在定义域的指定区间中，任意两个自变量前小后大时，对应函数值也前小后大。","originalWording":"对于定义在$D$上的函数$y=f(x)$，设区间$I$是$D$的一个子集．对于区间$I$上的任意给定的两个自变量的值$x_1$、$x_2$，当$x_1<x_2$时，如果总有$f(x_1)\\leqslant f(x_2)$，就称函数$y=f(x)$在区间$I$上是增函数（increasing function）；而\n如果总有$f(x_1)\\geqslant f(x_2)$，就称函数$y=f(x)$在区间$I$上是减函数（decreasing function）．\n特别地，如果总有$f(x_1)<f(x_2)$，就称函数$y=f(x)$在区间$I$上是严格增函数（strictly increasing function）；而如果总有$f(x_1)>f(x_2)$，就称函数$y=f(x)$在区间$I$上是严格减函数（strictly decreasing function）．\n“严格增”“严格减”“增”及“减”统称为函数的单调性．","scope":"材料支持范围：指定区间为定义域子集；任意两点与严格小于不可改为存在两点或允许取等号。","status":"material_supported","sourceId":"TB-B1","sourceEdition":"既有已接收教材/教案材料；不是新增2025独立细点条文","evidence":[{"id":"ev:book-1:TB-B1:monotonicity-definition:000","sourceId":"TB-B1","sourceSha256":"0b16b0d0bdf9aec3d83ff3208e422c5d65cc260ba5fc75febf3e000f04c7388d","locator":{"headingPath":["函数单调性的教材定义"],"part":"pdf","paragraphIndex":null,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":136,"pdfPage":136,"printedPage":129,"equationObjectId":null,"renderVariant":"original-textbook-pdf"},"quote":"对于定义在$D$上的函数$y=f(x)$，设区间$I$是$D$的一个子集．对于区间$I$上的任意给定的两个自变量的值$x_1$、$x_2$，当$x_1<x_2$时，如果总有$f(x_1)\\leqslant f(x_2)$，就称函数$y=f(x)$在区间$I$上是增函数（increasing function）；而","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":"r80/assets/04596ac92e0e6e7eaefc4b91.png","bytes":239182,"sha256":"04596ac92e0e6e7eaefc4b915591ab979bf4d3005f73b393dbb75ded40010af7","sourceId":"TB-B1","kind":"same_original_textbook_pdf_page","localOrigin":"/Users/yichen.zhang/vibe coding/codex/projects/数学教育平台/knowledge-network/review/textbook-content/page-evidence/cross-methods/core/TB-B1-pdf136.png","expectedHashMatched":null,"requestedPath":"increments/batch09-v1/evidence-textbook-followup/TB-B1-136.png"},"sourceTitle":"必修第一册","sourceStatus":"original_source_identity_preserved"},{"id":"ev:book-1:TB-B1:monotonicity-def